>> i := 0.
Imveliso bhala: ['Can we count to 10 using a whileTrue loop ?'], umgca-omtsha.
{ Imveliso bhala: i, umgca-omtsha. } ngelixa: { i yongeza: 1. <- (i ≤ 10). }.
Imveliso bhala: ['Can we count back from 10 to 0 using a whileFalse loop ?'], umgca-omtsha.
{ Imveliso bhala: i, umgca-omtsha. } ngelixa: { i thabatha: 1. <- (i ≥ 0). }.
